      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>Tonight, I had the privilege of delivering the invocation at the opening dinner of the Council on Foreign Relations annual Religion and Foreign Policy Workshop. I spoke right after a public conversation with Ambassador Sam Brownback, Ambassador for Religious Freedom. Here’s the prayer I offered:</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
