      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer was first published on Rabbi Jill Jacobs’s Facebook page, here. Simply described as an invocation for the event, I chose the title for this prayer based on its content. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
